---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Work
description: "Brand films, documentary and short-form content and ads by Bryant Atelier, a Byron Bay video production studio working across the Northern Rivers and Gold Coast."
preconnectVimeo: true
---
<header class="page-head on-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Work</span>
    <h1>Visual stories that deliver results.</h1>
    <p class="lede muted">Brand work and documentary, often blended. Short-form videos crafted to capture attention, build trust, and convert viewers into customers.</p>
    <div class="subhead" style="margin-bottom: 0">
      <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter work" data-filters>
        <button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
        {%- for c in categories %}
        <button type="button" data-filter="{{ c.key }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ c.label }}</button>
        {%- endfor %}
        <button type="button" data-filter="originals" aria-pressed="false">Originals</button>
      </div>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size: var(--fs-small)" aria-live="polite" data-filter-count></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="on-dark" aria-labelledby="films-h" data-filter-group>
  <h2 id="films-h" class="visually-hidden">Films</h2>
  <div class="work-grid work-grid--3">
    {%- for p in projects | visible %}
    {% include "partials/work-tile.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="on-dark section" aria-labelledby="reels-h" data-filter-group>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="subhead" style="margin-top: 0">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Content &amp; Ads</span>
        <h2 id="reels-h" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.4vw, 2.75rem); margin-top: 1rem; max-width: 22ch">Short-form ads and social content. {% draft %}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width: 26em">Tap to play. Sound on. {% draft %}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="reels">
    {%- for r in reels %}{% include "partials/reel-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-oxblood">
  <div class="container cta-band">
    <h2>Let's Connect!</h2>
    <a class="btn btn--bone" href="{{ site.bookingUrl }}">Book a call <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
